            "review_text": "Alta595\nMelbourne, Australia71 contributions\n0\nVery good Vietnamese seafood restaurant\nJan 2024 • Friends\nWe came here on a friend’s recommendation who had been here 3 weeks prior. Not too far from the night Market. \nWe turned up without a booking and it was not a problem. Service was very prompt. We ordered a bunch of dishes including fresh lobster from the tank. All 7 dishes arrived within 10-15minutes. Very tasty Vietnamese cuisine. I’d go back. \nBtw - the toilets were amazingly decorated and the cleanest I’ve been to by all standards around the world.\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2024",
