            "review_title": "Review at Ra Khoi Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Cowlpetus\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nAvoid this at all costs\nFeb 2022 • Family\nAvoid this at all costs. After one hour, no food came out despite constant reminder. We had to go find utensils on our own. After numerous reminders, one of many main dishes we ordered came out, but no rice. 10 minutes later, a dish of vegetable came out without sauces. \n\nAfter one and a half hour, you can look at our table to see how many dishes came out. The entire restaurant is closing down and yet I had almost nothing in my stomach. \n\nWe voiced our displeasure, 10 minutes later the “manager” came out and argued with us that we were really lucky to have some food on the table, other tables also had to cancel some of their orders. \n\nI guess we should feel privilege to be dining here with this service level. The review of this restaurant in the local review app “Foody” is 5.7, and I thought it was nothing to worry about. But here we are, experiencing this on our own. You can take a look at the photo to see what were on our table after 1.5 hours. \n\nAt the end of the day, we did not receive any apology, no discount, no action to remedy what happened to us. Dine here at your own risk.\nRead more\nWritten February 2, 2022",
