            "review_text": "JLandMike\nCochrane, Canada776 contributions\n0\nSeafood\nDec 2019 • Family\nAte here based on recos from our dive shop. We arrived around 6pm and the restaurant was just getting going. We had excellent service, not at all rude like many of the reviews say. Our greeter, server and the ice girl were all super friendly. We had prawns in tamarind sauce, fried rice, garlic vegetables and crispy fried squid. Service was fast and the food was great. 2 sodas and a beer and our bill was less than $25usd.\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2019",
