            "review_title": "Review at Ra Khoi Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Traveler102638\nLondon, United Kingdom13 contributions\n0\nReasonable food - appalling customer service\nNov 2019\nWe went here on the recommendation of our hotel.\n\nThe food was reasonable - lots of choice, especially if you like seafood. Also really popular with local people.\n\nBut that wasn't enough to make-up for the rudest waitress I've ever had in 5 continents. Literally rolling her eyes when we asked anything, tutting when we took a bit of time to decide on things, being totally unhelpful on everything, sullen and generally unpleasant.\n\nAnd she wasn't the only one like that. \n\nThat said, it didn't seem like we got this treatment because we were Western - she was the same with Vietnamese customers as well...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 5, 2019",
