            "review_text": "Chuck A\nGeorgetown, Texas183 contributions\n0\nWow just wow!\nOct 2019 • Friends\nWent here on a recommendation from our hotel staff as we wanted a great seafood place that mostly locals visit and boy were we not disappointed. This place has over the top seafood that you pick out of live tanks and then they cook it anyway you want. We had huge tamarind prawns, garlic butter scallops and a huge fish that was expertly grilled. Even the fried garlic vegetables and crab fried rice were amazing. All washed down with ice cold beer. So great we are two days in a row.\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2019",
